+# Life-play follow-through
+
+This follows handover 48. Release evidence belongs to handover 49 and the immutable download manifest.
+
+The current increment adds physical tool gestures, smooth walking/jogging, a second camera stick with character centring, stronger side-walk phases, useful home sockets and pet reactions. Existing detailed cooking and wardrobe menus remain accessible with controller focus.
+
+Further work should build on measured playtests:
+
+- Physical Fold 7/DualSense checks: simultaneous thumbs, Bluetooth reconnects, orientation/fullscreen transitions and frame time at several orbit angles.
+- Home action art for every costume and direction, with proper wheelchair reach/push/seating variants.
+- More complete garden walking and collision around the private house, preserving its separate detailed exterior scene.
+- Route planning around obstacles for longer tool chains; current walking stays local and stops rather than walking through a building.
+- Multi-instance furniture ownership and dedicated seating sockets per chair/sofa style.
+- More tactile recipe preparation and wardrobe previews without duplicating the existing authoritative recipe/equipment/purchase rules.
+- Visible damp soil and saved crop care if persistence is intentionally designed; current water cooldown remains transient by crop identity.
